{"3856830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stay Dead", "steam_appid": 3856830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/218605f9c417015fc24a5ccc120509ee.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAY DEAD is a fast-paced action game set in the tropical undead island of Porto Morto, where you and your family, the Rottingtons, are living your best afterlife. NO jobs, NO taxes, NO pulse, NO problems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is until C.A.R.E. (Curing Authority of Renegade Entities) shows up to “fix” you, by force. Their Cure Bots are converting zombies back into humans in the name of public safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you don’t need fixing. Being dead is the best thing that ever happened to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/dd6bfacf9d91f463f3b26b8e8d47a60c.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not running from zombies - You are the zombie, fighting off C.A.R.E., a for-profit health tech giant determined to &quot;FIX&quot; you. Bash, bite, and brawl through their Cure Bots before they turn your perfect afterlife into a nine-to-five nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/1f453d1f11954304a9c72b8a22209886.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your undead family and swap between them in real-time, mixing and matching their abilities for maximum damage. Experiment with combos, wreck some Cure Bots, and remind the living why zombies do it better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/9eae8958f639a73b26f90ca217bad52d.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porto Morto is your undead paradise, and it’s not going down without a fight. Scavenge parts, restore your town, and help your zombie neighbors reclaim their afterlife - one ridiculous restoration project at a time. But as you rebuild, you’ll uncover the real reason C.A.R.E. is so desperate to control zombie-kind… and it’s worse than just wiping you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, STAY DEAD is a love letter to weirdos, a rebellion against the idea that “normal” is worth saving. In Porto Morto, death is just the beginning. And it rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/218605f9c417015fc24a5ccc120509ee.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAY DEAD is a fast-paced action game set in the tropical undead island of Porto Morto, where you and your family, the Rottingtons, are living your best afterlife. NO jobs, NO taxes, NO pulse, NO problems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is until C.A.R.E. (Curing Authority of Renegade Entities) shows up to “fix” you, by force. Their Cure Bots are converting zombies back into humans in the name of public safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you don’t need fixing. Being dead is the best thing that ever happened to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/065918e48238ba67287c12656ed00d18.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/dd6bfacf9d91f463f3b26b8e8d47a60c.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not running from zombies - You are the zombie, fighting off C.A.R.E., a for-profit health tech giant determined to &quot;FIX&quot; you. Bash, bite, and brawl through their Cure Bots before they turn your perfect afterlife into a nine-to-five nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/bcc343da302c2f99df4c03867a979b6b.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/1f453d1f11954304a9c72b8a22209886.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue your undead family and swap between them in real-time, mixing and matching their abilities for maximum damage. Experiment with combos, wreck some Cure Bots, and remind the living why zombies do it better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/5e370e5ca3567981d20300751c669d3b.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/9eae8958f639a73b26f90ca217bad52d.avif?t=1761677714\" width=777 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porto Morto is your undead paradise, and it’s not going down without a fight. Scavenge parts, restore your town, and help your zombie neighbors reclaim their afterlife - one ridiculous restoration project at a time. But as you rebuild, you’ll uncover the real reason C.A.R.E. is so desperate to control zombie-kind… and it’s worse than just wiping you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, STAY DEAD is a love letter to weirdos, a rebellion against the idea that “normal” is worth saving. In Porto Morto, death is just the beginning. And it rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.poster.avif?t=1761677714\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.webm?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/extras/eb9ac1f591d0ee5f59528972d84c55ac.mp4?t=1761677714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "STAY DEAD is a fast-paced action game where you play as a zombie fighting back against an army of CureBots trying to make the afterlife &quot;normal.&quot; Tag-team combat, undead charm, and rebellious fun in the tropical undead town of Porto Morto.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/a3b5005540c5f0373eeac4735f1dc45fb221e46b/header.jpg?t=1761677714", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/387b2b5076a8293b9492582d632e6ff511702f54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761677714", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856830/387b2b5076a8293b9492582d632e6ff511702f54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761677714", "website": "https://www.staydead.io/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5 9600k / AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 / Radeon RX 6600 XT or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Animagic Studios"], "publishers": ["Animagic Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 62, "description